Yes, already there. Two test suites — `sra_rules` and `sra_pricing`. Run them like this:

**Run all tests at once (from the renewal_advisor folder):**

```bash
cd "C:\Users\admin\Downloads\database\renewal_advisor"
python -m pytest packages/sra_rules/tests/ packages/sra_pricing/tests/ -v
```

**Or run just one package:**

```bash
python -m pytest packages/sra_rules/tests/ -v
```

```bash
python -m pytest packages/sra_pricing/tests/ -v
```

**Or run a specific test file:**

```bash
python -m pytest packages/sra_rules/tests/test_contract.py -v
```

I already ran all of these earlier and got **136/136 passed** — but you can run them yourself now so you can show your manager the output. The `-v` flag gives you the full list of every test name and its result.
